      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create pkce_login.py in the current working directory.\nTask: implements a PKCE login flow for public clients.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda0bd1d00172AexoxBt3oGXr",
