    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `profile_claims.py` that fetches and normalizes federated user profile claims using a concrete external provider, I need to select a provider and integrate its API. I'll choose Google's OAuth2 for this task as it is a widely used and well-documented service for fetching user profile information. The code will import the necessary libraries, authenticate using OAuth2, and fetch user profile claims. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887821034,
          "start": 1789887818513
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda0ab11001vix0W3huGXKlrF",
      "message_id": "msg_0bda0a5e7001PzUPxqg3sYkE68",
